# Records docs/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs): `vhs demo.tape`
# Needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the environment.

Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "site-doctor demo --no-open"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 90s
